---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import NewsletterForm from '../components/NewsletterForm.astro';
import newsletter from '../../../data/newsletter.json';
---
<Base title="Letters from Jevan | Jevan Goldsmith" description={newsletter.description} canonical="https://jevangoldsmith.com/newsletter.html" pageType="CollectionPage">
  <main class="newsletter-page-content">
    <header class="newsletter-intro">
      <p class="newsletter-kicker">Jevan's monthly update</p>
      <h1>{newsletter.headline}</h1>
      <p class="newsletter-lead">Once a month, I’ll send you a letter with new essays, notes on what I’m building, and something worth reading. If a thought stays with you—or you see it differently—write back. I’d like to hear about it.</p>
      <NewsletterForm id="newsletter-signup" source="newsletter-page" />
      <p class="newsletter-lead">Prefer a feed reader? <a href="/rss.xml">Subscribe to the essay RSS feed</a>.</p>
      <a class="sample-link" href={newsletter.sampleUrl}>Read a sample before you join <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </header>
    <section class="newsletter-expect" aria-labelledby="expect-title">
      <h2 id="expect-title">What's inside</h2>
      <div class="newsletter-topics">
        <article><span>01</span><h3>New writing</h3><p>Essays and shorter notes, gathered in one email so you can read at your own pace.</p></article>
        <article><span>02</span><h3>What I’m taking from it</h3><p>What happened, what surprised me, and what I’d try differently next time.</p></article>
        <article><span>03</span><h3>Something to pass on</h3><p>A book, a tool, or an idea, with a note on why it stuck with me.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="newsletter-preview" aria-labelledby="preview-title">
      <p class="newsletter-kicker">Start here</p>
      <h2 id="preview-title">A look inside</h2>
      <p>The website, the projects behind it, and a simple way to turn a busy week into a useful next step.</p>
      <a href={newsletter.sampleUrl}>Read the sample update <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </section>
    <section class="newsletter-questions" aria-labelledby="questions-title">
      <h2 id="questions-title">A few things to know</h2>
      <details><summary>How often will you write?</summary><p>Once a month, with links to new writing and notes from the work. You won’t get a separate email for every post.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What happens after I sign up?</summary><p>The list is currently managed by me. Your request is sent to my inbox; there is no automatic welcome email. I’ll add you to the monthly letter.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is it free?</summary><p>Yes. You can read the sample and use the weekly-review template before deciding to join.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I reply?</summary><p>Yes. Questions, useful ideas and honest feedback are welcome. You can also <a href="/contact.html">send me a note here</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I leave?</summary><p>You can ask to leave at any time by replying to an update or emailing <a href="mailto:hello@jevangoldsmith.com">hello@jevangoldsmith.com</a>.</p></details>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
<style>
  .newsletter-page-content { max-width: 1000px; margin: auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; }
  .newsletter-intro { max-width: 660px; padding-bottom: 3rem; }
  .newsletter-kicker { color: var(--text-light); font-size: .73rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .14em; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .newsletter-intro h1 { color: var(--text-color); font-family: Chivo, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4rem); letter-spacing: -.05em; line-height: 1.05; margin: 0 0 1.4rem; }
  .newsletter-lead { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .sample-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.25rem; font-size: .9rem; }
  a { color: var(--text-color); text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  h2 { font-family: Chivo, sans-serif; color: var(--text-color); font-size: 1.7rem; letter-spacing: -.025em; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .newsletter-expect, .newsletter-preview, .newsletter-questions { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 2.5rem 0; }
  .newsletter-topics { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2rem; }
  .newsletter-topics span { color: var(--text-light); font-size: .72rem; }
  .newsletter-topics h3 { color: var(--text-color); font-size: 1rem; margin: .75rem 0; }
  .newsletter-topics p, .newsletter-preview p, .newsletter-questions p { color: var(--text-light); font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .newsletter-preview { max-width: 680px; }
  .newsletter-questions details { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 1rem 0; }
  .newsletter-questions summary { color: var(--text-color); cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  .newsletter-questions p { max-width: 650px; margin: .8rem 0 0; }
  @media (max-width: 650px) { .newsletter-page-content { padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem; } .newsletter-topics { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; } }
</style>
